WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.371
Entrepreneurship begins with understanding a problem and the people affected by it.

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:09.470
A product idea becomes stronger when assumptions about demand, cost and value are tested.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:14.205
Revenue is money earned from sales; profit also accounts for the relevant costs.

00:00:15.205 --> 00:00:21.205
Revenue is ₹400 and variable cost is ₹200, leaving ₹200 toward fixed costs and profit.

00:00:21.205 --> 00:00:28.005
It is not automatically ₹200 net profit because rent, equipment and other fixed costs may still apply.

00:00:29.005 --> 00:00:31.731
What is profit in the worked extension?

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:35.235
Subtract both variable and stated fixed costs from revenue.
